// Higher Ground · Sub · answering rhythm · 176 BPM · C minor
// Eight-bar root sequence follows this song’s chord progression. Keep the sub centered.
// One cycle = one 4/4 bar. Sample slots are installed with this session.
setCpm(176 / 4)

$: note("<ab1 ab1 bb1 bb1 c2 c2 eb2 eb2>").struct("1 0 1 0 0 1 1 1").s("sine").attack(.01).release(.08).gain(0.288).lpf(150)
